{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1000_p", "source_sha256": "655e2407bdc0f05d2cf7fd1ffa08e960cd451a03ccf1c274bf75dbb27f3ed6ca", "ja": "（アイドル達と花見にやってきた。気分転換になれば\nと企画してみたんだが、みんな楽しそうでよかった！)", "zh": "（和偶像们一起来赏花了。本来是想借此转换一下心情，看到大家都玩得很开心，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "8ecb1f3c27decd224b370f38731acaccf9f43fddd8a64e8184fb142030695a05", "ja": "スキー、アリアリのアリーッ！\n兄ちゃんに花を咲かせましょ～！　そりゃ～！", "zh": "超喜欢，绝对喜欢——！\n让哥哥身上开出花来吧～！来吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1002_null", "source_sha256": "277df804ffda70b26ac7f351e5aeee217b850fd39cfc6b16744f1cd9eb41963c", "ja": "ドササーッ！", "zh": "哗啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e9ee07d41f2d5220fc3ad47a20b3d42cdd7b1edb0061b908edaf0902d412bb6b", "ja": "うっぷ！　大量の花びらで窒息するところだった。\n……亜美、なにするんだ！", "zh": "唔噗！差点被这一大堆花瓣给憋死了。\n……亚美，你干什么呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "1a6e44b38db16d1029c91bdaee2398c32989884ee7136b73cf1e778ac6580240", "ja": "んっふっふ～、よそ見はキンモツだよ兄ちゃん！\nお花見なんだから、みーんなで楽しまなきゃ！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～东张西望可是大忌哦，大哥！\n这可是赏花，大家必须一起好好享受才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f3f93978f6968649ae21d8bf067eedf61272eaefaf1ff2176a9d789df237cde5", "ja": "そうだな。でも亜美こそ、俺に花を咲かせてる場合か？\n可憐が、すごい量のお花見弁当を持ってきてたけど。", "zh": "是啊。不过亚美你才是，哪有时间往我身上插花？可怜带来了好多赏花便当。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "3f1b9d6de282754601aa1e28fe9bf001a177ad897010e8cdf2c2ce606a3dfc60", "ja": "大丈夫、亜美のはちゃーんともらってあるかんね！\nはい、兄ちゃんにもお団子あげる！　あ～ん♪", "zh": "没问题，亚美那份已经好～好拿到了嘛！\n来，分给哥一个团子！啊～嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1007_p", "source_sha256": "00f3d14577cb95d09cf4b7e5532795a5a6e9b7d70b63f3b0c7438bad012fd6c7", "ja": "えっ、いいのか？\nじゃあ、ありがたく。あーん……", "zh": "咦，可以吗？\n那我就不客气了。啊——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "7a3aa18578565a9028de02731fa0f2950baa8bd57a114daf4953abe995ebbc70", "ja": "ぶすっ。", "zh": "噗嗤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b758df2556e8b1a804c9f038f688bf630ba0b4b7a3d3391afd220318a50f2591", "ja": "うわあ！　ぶすっ、じゃない！　危ないじゃないか！", "zh": "哇啊！别“噗呲”啦！很危险的好不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "2f4686d0b2a80d85e25a74b0248566b55f213a0e5901abeaa74ff81d66a547e6", "ja": "えへへ～、ホントに刺すわけないっしょ！\nはい兄ちゃん、やっぱ自分で食べてね！　ばいきゅー！", "zh": "嘿嘿～，怎么可能真的刺下去嘛！\n来，哥哥，还是你自己吃吧！拜拜咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0142_1011_p", "source_sha256": "56525c9325a1f86d23a7d9e057ad712e07ca6f8206d25e17b17c2895bdca61b8", "ja": "(花びらの付いた串団子を押しつけ、すぐに走り去る。\n本当に、花より団子……いや、笑顔、かな！)", "zh": "（把沾着花瓣的团子串塞过来，马上就跑开了。\n真是比起花，更爱团子……不，是笑容吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
